        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 38-A5, Elite Collection Cambridge Knob with Ketme Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSo often traditional knobs are pegged as having an old world feel, but the Half-Round Cambridge Knobset manages to straddle the fine line of contemporary decor fashions while still bringing the elegant beauty of classic styles. The Cambridge Knob with Ketme Rose is available in 5 finishes. Since it is part of Fusion's Elite Collection, it has concealed mounting screws. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 38 A5 Half-Round Cambridge Knob with Traditional Ketme Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Cambridge Knobset with Ketme Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Half-Round Cambridge Knobset, Fusion 38-A5",
                "description": "Fusion 38-A5, Half-Round Cambridge Knobset -- So often traditional knobs are pegged as having an old world feel, but the Half-Round Cambridge Knobset manages to straddle the fine line of contemporary decor fashions while still bringing the elegant beauty of classic styles. The Cambridge Knob with Ketme Rose is available in 5 finishes. Since it is part of Fusion's Elite Collection, it has concealed mounting screws. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
